1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:03,010
(Love In Sync)

2
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:12,320
(Kim Myung Soo)

3
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:18,990
(Kang Min Ah)

4
00:00:38,710 --> 00:00:41,880
(Love In Sync)

5
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:44,789
(All people, incidents, and backgrounds...)

6
00:00:44,790 --> 00:00:45,919
(in this drama are fictitious and unrelated to reality.)

7
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:47,120
(Also, children and animals were filmed under production guidelines.)

8
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:58,200
Ji An.

9
00:00:59,670 --> 00:01:00,670
Are you okay?

10
00:01:26,290 --> 00:01:27,630
Why are you out here in the cold?

11
00:01:31,970 --> 00:01:33,940
Is something wrong?

12
00:01:39,270 --> 00:01:40,280
Are you okay?

13
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:41,880
Are you hurt?

14
00:01:45,250 --> 00:01:46,350
Then what is wrong?

15
00:01:47,850 --> 00:01:48,850
I'm sorry.

16
00:01:49,620 --> 00:01:50,620
I'm sorry.

17
00:01:52,720 --> 00:01:54,360
What is it? What's wrong?

18
00:01:58,390 --> 00:01:59,630
Tell me.

19
00:02:21,950 --> 00:02:24,750
How did you end up in a place like this?

20
00:02:28,860 --> 00:02:30,930
I wasn't expecting a tearful reunion,

21
00:02:32,030 --> 00:02:33,030
but still,

22
00:02:33,630 --> 00:02:35,830
I wasn't expecting to be treated this coldly.

23
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:40,900
Aren't you even curious how I've been all this time?

24
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:43,040
Have you...

25
00:02:45,470 --> 00:02:46,470
been well?

26
00:02:47,110 --> 00:02:48,110
How could I have been?

27
00:02:48,610 --> 00:02:50,910
A child can leave the nest and live well,

28
00:02:52,350 --> 00:02:53,350
but a parent...

29
00:02:54,820 --> 00:02:55,920
can't do that so easily.

30
00:02:57,750 --> 00:02:58,750
Can you still...

31
00:02:59,650 --> 00:03:01,620
not be alone when it rains?

32
00:03:03,990 --> 00:03:06,090
It started after that accident when you were a child, right?

33
00:03:06,730 --> 00:03:09,760
You started trembling every time it rained.

34
00:03:11,130 --> 00:03:12,869
Because of you, even when I was in the US,

35
00:03:12,870 --> 00:03:14,500
whenever I heard it was raining in Korea,

36
00:03:15,500 --> 00:03:16,940
I would get so worried.

37
00:03:18,170 --> 00:03:19,170
You...

38
00:03:20,210 --> 00:03:23,310
will never understand how a mother feels.

39
00:03:24,350 --> 00:03:27,780
The person who saved me from that accident...

40
00:03:31,850 --> 00:03:32,850
Was it really you?

41
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:39,060
Kiddo, stay with me. Kiddo.

42
00:03:43,030 --> 00:03:45,430
Sweetie, are you awake?

43
00:03:48,870 --> 00:03:50,170
Thank goodness.

44
00:03:51,070 --> 00:03:52,110
My baby.

45
00:03:52,870 --> 00:03:55,740
Mommy was so worried.

46
00:03:56,380 --> 00:03:57,510
What about the man?

47
00:03:58,180 --> 00:03:59,180
A man?

48
00:03:59,910 --> 00:04:03,020
A man saved me.

49
00:04:03,650 --> 00:04:04,750
He promised he would save me.

50
00:04:07,190 --> 00:04:08,690
My poor baby, you must have been dreaming.

51
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:12,230
- No, I saw him. - It was me.

52
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:15,500
I'm the one who found you, Ji An.

53
00:04:16,029 --> 00:04:19,930
You were the one who saved me?

54
00:04:20,300 --> 00:04:23,400
Of course. I'm your mother.

55
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,240
If it wasn't me...

56
00:04:25,940 --> 00:04:27,180
besides me, your mother,

57
00:04:28,140 --> 00:04:30,010
who would risk their life for you?

58
00:04:32,180 --> 00:04:33,180
Right?

59
00:04:34,520 --> 00:04:35,520
You're lying.

60
00:04:36,450 --> 00:04:38,190
How long were you going to lie to me?

61
00:04:39,090 --> 00:04:40,860
You weren't the one who saved me that day.

62
00:04:41,690 --> 00:04:44,960
So you remember it all.

63
00:04:46,390 --> 00:04:48,700
Why did you lie about it?

64
00:04:49,860 --> 00:04:51,370
- Why? - It was for you.

65
00:04:53,170 --> 00:04:54,440
Not for yourself?

66
00:04:55,100 --> 00:04:57,970
To a seven-year-old child,

67
00:04:59,140 --> 00:05:01,880
how could I say that someone died trying to save you?

68
00:05:03,410 --> 00:05:04,410
Especially when...

69
00:05:05,810 --> 00:05:07,250
the accident happened because of you.

70
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:10,989
Hey, kid,

71
00:05:10,990 --> 00:05:13,320
this is a very dangerous scene to film.

72
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:15,760
- It's not that simple... - I still want to do it.

73
00:05:17,390 --> 00:05:19,530
I can do it.

74
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:22,060
If you hadn't been so stubborn that day,

75
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:24,500
the accident wouldn't have happened,

76
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:28,340
and that man wouldn't have died saving you.

77
00:05:29,470 --> 00:05:32,340
But what mother in the world...

78
00:05:32,970 --> 00:05:36,080
could tell her own child such a cruel truth?

79
00:05:47,150 --> 00:05:49,490
That man, Cha Eun Hwan...

80
00:05:50,860 --> 00:05:52,430
He doesn't know about this yet, does he?

81
00:05:54,460 --> 00:05:55,460
Good.

82
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,570
He must never find out.

83
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:01,940
How devastated would he be?

84
00:06:03,540 --> 00:06:07,110
His own father died because of you.

85
00:06:23,990 --> 00:06:24,990
My daughter,

86
00:06:26,530 --> 00:06:29,660
it has been hard for you without me, hasn't it?

87
00:06:32,070 --> 00:06:33,970
You do not have to worry anymore.

88
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:37,910
Your mother is here now.

89
00:06:50,950 --> 00:06:51,950
("Yu Ji An is Under 1-Person Agency,")

90
00:06:51,951 --> 00:06:53,450
("And Her Mother Will Be The CEO To Manage All Activities")

91
00:07:00,490 --> 00:07:01,960
That is absolutely out of the question.

92
00:07:02,260 --> 00:07:03,260
And why is that?

93
00:07:03,930 --> 00:07:06,200
A film has a set story.

94
00:07:06,570 --> 00:07:07,669
You think one can just change screen time...

95
00:07:07,670 --> 00:07:09,840
to suit their own tastes?

96
00:07:10,170 --> 00:07:11,410
Why not?

97
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:15,009
You think of this film...

98
00:07:15,010 --> 00:07:16,010
as a work of art, don't you, Director?

99
00:07:16,980 --> 00:07:20,210
But art is only art if it sells.

100
00:07:21,350 --> 00:07:22,880
If it does not sell, what is it but trash?

101
00:07:22,980 --> 00:07:24,389
Listen here, Yu Ji An's mother.

102
00:07:24,390 --> 00:07:27,960
Let's think about this rationally.

103
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:31,560
In the current situation, whose name...

104
00:07:32,390 --> 00:07:33,930
will help make this film a box office hit?

105
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:38,400
Han Yi Jin's first-ever leading role?

106
00:07:40,100 --> 00:07:43,970
Or Yu Ji An's first comeback after her scandal?

107
00:07:49,180 --> 00:07:53,850
- It would be Yu Ji An, wouldn't it? - Director Kang.

108
00:07:54,050 --> 00:07:57,390
Come on, it is a fact.

109
00:07:58,450 --> 00:08:00,120
The answer is already right there.

110
00:08:00,450 --> 00:08:02,390
Why is he struggling with it so much?

111
00:08:03,660 --> 00:08:04,989
Surely you are not using...

112
00:08:04,990 --> 00:08:07,260
other people's money for your art...

113
00:08:08,030 --> 00:08:10,400
just to satisfy your own ego, are you?

114
00:08:10,970 --> 00:08:12,100
I cannot give you much time.

115
00:08:12,630 --> 00:08:14,039
Let me know by tomorrow whether you...

116
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,670
are going to increase our Ji An's screen time...

117
00:08:16,340 --> 00:08:17,470
or not.

118
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:23,210
Ha Yul's mom, you have a visitor.

119
00:08:24,050 --> 00:08:25,050
Who is it?

120
00:08:46,530 --> 00:08:47,599
Ji An, where are you?

121
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,800
Why are you not answering your phone?

122
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:50,770
I had something to take care of.

123
00:08:51,410 --> 00:08:53,270
Why? Is something wrong?

124
00:08:55,510 --> 00:08:58,110
How could you do this without even discussing it with me?

125
00:09:00,380 --> 00:09:02,250
Why would I need to discuss it with you?

126
00:09:02,780 --> 00:09:05,190
The outcome would have been the same even if I had discussed it.

127
00:09:05,520 --> 00:09:08,820
This is Yi Jin's first leading role in the ten years since her debut.

128
00:09:10,260 --> 00:09:12,490
- But to do this... - What business is that of yours?

129
00:09:15,030 --> 00:09:18,470
Who on earth ruined you like this while I was gone?

130
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:20,200
I told you, didn't I?

131
00:09:20,630 --> 00:09:23,340
Once your status is set, it is hard to change.

132
00:09:24,070 --> 00:09:26,310
After everything I have done to get you to this point,

133
00:09:26,940 --> 00:09:29,910
you are going to play second fiddle to the likes of Yi Jin?

134
00:09:33,250 --> 00:09:34,250
Listen carefully.

135
00:09:34,850 --> 00:09:36,919
If you want to live the rest of your life...

136
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:38,250
as the top star Yu Ji An,

137
00:09:39,150 --> 00:09:42,220
stop caring about what other people feel.

138
00:09:44,390 --> 00:09:47,030
Only think about yourself.

139
00:09:49,030 --> 00:09:51,700
Everyone else is just your competition.

140
00:10:14,460 --> 00:10:15,460
Hey, Yi Jin.

141
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:18,960
I heard from Director Kang.

142
00:10:20,290 --> 00:10:21,660
This again? It is always the same with you.

143
00:10:22,330 --> 00:10:25,130
- This is a misunderstanding... - A misunderstanding?

144
00:10:28,070 --> 00:10:29,070
What misunderstanding?

145
00:10:30,170 --> 00:10:31,910
You were always like this, even when we were idols.

146
00:10:33,170 --> 00:10:34,839
If there was anything even slightly good,

147
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:36,540
be it an outfit, a song, or an opportunity,

148
00:10:38,710 --> 00:10:40,050
you always snatched it away.

149
00:10:42,380 --> 00:10:44,320
I thought you had changed a little, but...

150
00:10:46,420 --> 00:10:48,320
I guess people do not change that easily, do they?

151
00:10:50,790 --> 00:10:52,690
The money I gave Mi Jeong was really for her hospital bills.

152
00:10:53,190 --> 00:10:54,330
The reason I was in touch with her...

153
00:10:55,160 --> 00:10:56,930
was because I was trying to persuade her somehow.

154
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,400
And as for what happened with the CEO Noh...

155
00:11:00,530 --> 00:11:01,540
You are right.

156
00:11:02,570 --> 00:11:04,609
- I did it on purpose to screw you. - Han Yi Jin.

157
00:11:04,610 --> 00:11:10,610
You always take what is mine without a second thought.

158
00:11:14,220 --> 00:11:15,450
I absolutely despised you for it.

159
00:11:17,990 --> 00:11:18,990
I wish you would just...

160
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:22,790
disappear from my life.

161
00:11:29,760 --> 00:11:33,530
(Establishing the Rule of Law)

162
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:40,570
(Establishing the Rule of Law)

163
00:11:45,780 --> 00:11:48,220
(J.An Entertainment)

164
00:11:48,880 --> 00:11:49,950
(Ministry of Law)

165
00:11:50,180 --> 00:11:52,920
(Kim Jun Sik)

166
00:11:55,190 --> 00:11:56,259
("Yu Ji An is Under 1-Person Agency,")

167
00:11:56,260 --> 00:11:57,319
("And Her Mother Will Be The CEO To Manage All Activities")

168
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:59,290
("Actress Yu Ji An Will Start Her Activities...")

169
00:12:04,700 --> 00:12:05,900
A long-term exclusive contract?

170
00:12:06,900 --> 00:12:09,600
You can't let that child dictate things forever.

171
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,470
If you do this one thing for me,

172
00:12:11,710 --> 00:12:15,510
I'll entrust her entire management to you...

173
00:12:15,940 --> 00:12:19,180
for the rest of Ji An's career in this industry.

174
00:12:20,310 --> 00:12:21,380
You know how she is.

175
00:12:22,150 --> 00:12:24,790
If I tell Ji An to die,

176
00:12:25,050 --> 00:12:27,020
she's the kind of girl who would even pretend to.

177
00:12:27,490 --> 00:12:30,590
So what are you asking to do?

178
00:12:31,560 --> 00:12:33,990
To give you what you want,

179
00:12:34,160 --> 00:12:36,730
I have to get what I want first.

180
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:39,670
Whatever it takes...

181
00:12:40,770 --> 00:12:42,670
Make Ji An come back to me.

182
00:12:44,070 --> 00:12:45,369
She lures in me minding my own business,

183
00:12:45,370 --> 00:12:46,740
and makes a fool out of me.

184
00:12:47,470 --> 00:12:49,410
And she thinks she can get a happy ending all by herself?

185
00:12:50,310 --> 00:12:51,880
That would just be unfair to me.

186
00:12:59,250 --> 00:13:00,490
Have you been well?

187
00:13:00,790 --> 00:13:03,620
It's been a while, Mr. Cha. What brings you here?

188
00:13:04,630 --> 00:13:07,189
I was wondering how Seon Woo was doing,

189
00:13:07,190 --> 00:13:08,830
so I thought I'd stop by.

190
00:13:09,860 --> 00:13:10,860
Please have a seat.

191
00:13:14,570 --> 00:13:17,440
But I have a feeling Seon Woo is just an excuse,

192
00:13:19,070 --> 00:13:21,410
and that you're really here to ask about someone else.

193
00:13:24,680 --> 00:13:26,810
Is she doing all right?

194
00:13:28,380 --> 00:13:30,679
Actually, I was just about to contact you...

195
00:13:30,680 --> 00:13:32,390
about Ji An, Mr. Cha.

196
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:34,690
Is something wrong?

197
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:39,490
Something's off with Ji An.

198
00:13:41,460 --> 00:13:43,500
She can't focus on set,

199
00:13:43,930 --> 00:13:46,270
and her emotional scenes aren't what they used to be.

200
00:13:46,530 --> 00:13:47,600
More than anything...

201
00:13:50,040 --> 00:13:51,840
She seems very fragile.

202
00:13:52,610 --> 00:13:53,669
To be honest,

203
00:13:53,670 --> 00:13:55,110
because of the recent issue with her mother,

204
00:13:55,340 --> 00:13:57,710
I wasn't feeling too great about Ji An either,

205
00:13:59,110 --> 00:14:00,280
but now I just feel sorry for her.

206
00:14:00,950 --> 00:14:04,950
I'm worried something might happen to her if she keeps this up.

207
00:14:13,090 --> 00:14:14,090
I'm afraid.

208
00:14:15,700 --> 00:14:18,330
I'm afraid she'll show up again and ruin my life.

209
00:14:19,970 --> 00:14:21,870
I'm afraid I'll go back as the person I was.

210
00:14:32,910 --> 00:14:34,450
- Hello. - Hello.

211
00:15:05,450 --> 00:15:06,610
Of course.

212
00:15:07,750 --> 00:15:09,220
There's no way he would be here.

213
00:15:17,590 --> 00:15:20,390
(CEO Kim)

214
00:15:24,470 --> 00:15:25,470
What's this about?

215
00:15:28,640 --> 00:15:29,640
What?

216
00:15:30,370 --> 00:15:31,410
What do you mean...

217
00:15:32,010 --> 00:15:34,440
I heard you took good care of my Ji An...

218
00:15:34,580 --> 00:15:38,210
by being her manager while I was gone.

219
00:15:38,910 --> 00:15:40,250
As her mother, I'm grateful.

220
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:42,520
Not at all.

221
00:15:42,980 --> 00:15:46,420
But you're not her manager anymore.

222
00:15:47,490 --> 00:15:48,690
What I'm saying is...

223
00:15:49,260 --> 00:15:50,819
Please refrain from actions...

224
00:15:50,820 --> 00:15:52,990
that could give people the wrong idea,

225
00:15:53,330 --> 00:15:54,700
like what you did earlier.

226
00:15:55,400 --> 00:15:56,799
She just made her comeback.

227
00:15:56,800 --> 00:15:59,700
It wouldn't be good for a scandal, would it?

228
00:16:01,740 --> 00:16:04,240
Do you understand what I'm saying?

229
00:16:04,810 --> 00:16:07,040
It seemed like Ji An was having a very hard time.

230
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:09,610
I appreciate your concern for my daughter,

231
00:16:10,110 --> 00:16:13,050
but I'm here now, so stay out of it.

232
00:16:17,050 --> 00:16:18,320
I'm afraid I can't do that.

233
00:16:20,550 --> 00:16:22,220
I may not be her manager anymore,

234
00:16:22,790 --> 00:16:26,390
but I am Yu Ji An's designated counsellor.

235
00:16:27,290 --> 00:16:29,829
As a professional, I believe Ji An's condition...

236
00:16:29,830 --> 00:16:31,970
is not something I can ignore.

237
00:16:32,630 --> 00:16:36,370
So I plan on taking a very active interest from now on.

238
00:16:40,610 --> 00:16:42,880
You're just like your father.

239
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:46,410
Starting with your looks,

240
00:16:48,720 --> 00:16:49,749
all the way to your arrogant meddling...

241
00:16:49,750 --> 00:16:50,820
in others' business.

242
00:16:52,790 --> 00:16:56,290
Don't worry. Ji An doesn't know anything.

243
00:16:57,220 --> 00:17:00,630
And of course, she should never find out.

244
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:02,700
If she were to find out,

245
00:17:03,060 --> 00:17:05,230
there's no telling what she might do.

246
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:08,369
As her counsellor, you must know.

247
00:17:08,800 --> 00:17:10,599
That she's more fragile than she appears.

248
00:17:11,339 --> 00:17:13,869
In the past, she tried to hurt herself...

249
00:17:15,280 --> 00:17:16,810
over something trivial.

250
00:17:17,950 --> 00:17:19,310
She's that fragile.

251
00:17:20,180 --> 00:17:21,720
If she finds out this secret,

252
00:17:22,420 --> 00:17:24,319
what she might do...

253
00:17:25,349 --> 00:17:27,589
is painfully obvious, isn't it?

254
00:17:30,490 --> 00:17:32,560
You seem like a smart man,

255
00:17:34,090 --> 00:17:39,430
so I trust you understand what I mean.

256
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:58,890
I told you about this ahead of time.

257
00:17:59,020 --> 00:18:00,089
No, that's not it.

258
00:18:00,090 --> 00:18:02,159
I'm not trying to change the concept.

259
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:05,689
Let's stick to the storyboard. But look. Look at the lighting.

260
00:18:05,690 --> 00:18:07,529
- It's so plain. - No, the studio...

261
00:18:07,530 --> 00:18:09,059
Director, if you want to elevate this,

262
00:18:09,060 --> 00:18:10,199
please just listen to me.

263
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:12,130
If we add a bit more detail to the lighting...

264
00:18:12,500 --> 00:18:13,930
Where have you been all this time?

265
00:18:14,100 --> 00:18:16,070
I believe I told you I wasn't coming back here.

266
00:18:16,240 --> 00:18:19,070
But you're here now. You came here on your own.

267
00:18:19,570 --> 00:18:21,240
I had no other choice.

268
00:18:21,580 --> 00:18:24,310
- I wonder why that is. - Cut.

269
00:18:26,150 --> 00:18:28,480
Hey, Ji An. About your acting...

270
00:18:31,020 --> 00:18:33,220
Let's take a quick break.

271
00:19:17,530 --> 00:19:19,630
If you keep giving us this kind of schedule...

272
00:19:20,030 --> 00:19:21,069
You mean, she has to focus on the filming all week...

273
00:19:21,070 --> 00:19:22,100
once again in the second week of this month.

274
00:19:22,300 --> 00:19:25,340
She'll be busy then, reviewing offers for a new project.

275
00:19:25,540 --> 00:19:26,669
You ask for more screen time, but then say...

276
00:19:26,670 --> 00:19:28,039
it's hard to cooperate with the filming schedule.

277
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:29,609
So what exactly do you expect me to do?

278
00:19:29,610 --> 00:19:31,210
Why are you getting so upset?

279
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:33,379
We've already been considerate. This all happened because...

280
00:19:33,380 --> 00:19:35,220
we had to revise the script to give her more screen time.

281
00:19:35,350 --> 00:19:36,720
How much more accommodating do you want us to be?

282
00:19:37,280 --> 00:19:39,020
- No. - I'll do it.

283
00:19:40,390 --> 00:19:42,990
I said I'll do it. So both of you, please get out.

284
00:19:44,190 --> 00:19:47,130
- Ji An. - I said I'll do it. Everyone stop.

285
00:19:49,430 --> 00:19:50,430
Let's go.

286
00:20:02,080 --> 00:20:04,810
("Yu Ji An's Another Abuse of Power Controversy Even After Comeback")

287
00:20:07,010 --> 00:20:08,819
(If this keeps happening, maybe it's just her personality?)

288
00:20:08,820 --> 00:20:10,250
(Don't the staff's stories seem more credible?)

289
00:20:57,900 --> 00:20:59,770
("Yu Ji An's Another Abuse of Power Controversy Even After Comeback")

290
00:21:25,460 --> 00:21:26,460
Mr. Cha.

291
00:21:27,890 --> 00:21:28,930
Ji An...

292
00:21:29,960 --> 00:21:31,060
I can't get in touch with her.

293
00:21:36,240 --> 00:21:37,240
She's not on the second floor either.

294
00:21:37,241 --> 00:21:38,540
This is driving me crazy.

295
00:21:49,250 --> 00:21:51,850
Where could she have gone without her phone?

296
00:21:52,190 --> 00:21:55,220
- When did you last hear from her? - Probably yesterday.

297
00:21:55,420 --> 00:21:57,060
Then why are you only looking for her now?

298
00:21:57,720 --> 00:21:59,790
I just thought she needed time alone to clear her head.

299
00:22:00,190 --> 00:22:01,700
She's been through a lot lately.

300
00:22:02,300 --> 00:22:03,700
Is there any place she might have gone?

301
00:22:04,130 --> 00:22:05,770
She's always either at home or on set.

302
00:22:08,940 --> 00:22:09,970
Don't tell me...

303
00:22:11,300 --> 00:22:12,940
She's not thinking of doing something bad again, is she?

304
00:22:13,640 --> 00:22:15,710
She was just like this before that happened.

305
00:22:19,410 --> 00:22:20,450
Where are you going?

306
00:22:22,250 --> 00:22:24,550
Something's off about Ji An.

307
00:22:25,550 --> 00:22:27,420
She seems very fragile.

308
00:22:28,150 --> 00:22:29,289
I'm starting to feel sorry for her.

309
00:22:29,290 --> 00:22:32,260
I'm worried something might happen to her.

310
00:22:32,390 --> 00:22:33,760
(1 dollar)

311
00:22:34,830 --> 00:22:37,030
As her counsellor, you must know.

312
00:22:37,700 --> 00:22:39,500
That she's more fragile than she appears.

313
00:22:40,270 --> 00:22:44,340
In the past, she tried to hurt herself over something trivial.

314
00:22:48,780 --> 00:22:49,779
(1 dollar)

315
00:22:49,780 --> 00:22:50,780
Don't tell me...

316
00:22:51,580 --> 00:22:53,250
She's not thinking of doing something bad again, is she?

317
00:22:54,250 --> 00:22:56,380
She was just like this before that happened.

318
00:23:03,460 --> 00:23:04,460
Yu Ji An.

319
00:23:05,160 --> 00:23:06,390
Where in the world are you?

320
00:23:08,300 --> 00:23:09,330
Please.

321
00:23:10,900 --> 00:23:11,930
Please.

322
00:23:17,600 --> 00:23:19,169
Actress Yu Ji An, who recently made...

323
00:23:19,170 --> 00:23:22,140
a comeback after overcoming an abuse of power controversy,

324
00:23:22,340 --> 00:23:24,680
is now embroiled in rumours that she has gone into hiding.

325
00:23:25,010 --> 00:23:26,909
Reports say she has cancelled all her appointments...

326
00:23:26,910 --> 00:23:29,580
and suddenly disappeared.

327
00:23:30,080 --> 00:23:32,819
Her agency has issued a full denial,

328
00:23:32,820 --> 00:23:35,320
claiming it is for health reasons.

329
00:23:35,620 --> 00:23:38,359
However, due to recent false accusations...

330
00:23:38,360 --> 00:23:39,960
and a series of incidents involving her,

331
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:42,400
there is growing concern for her safety...

332
00:23:42,530 --> 00:23:45,670
on social media and in fan communities.

333
00:23:46,300 --> 00:23:49,470
Does Eun Hwan know that you found out?

334
00:23:52,110 --> 00:23:53,270
Not yet.

335
00:23:54,010 --> 00:23:55,110
Good.

336
00:23:55,740 --> 00:23:56,980
If you feel so sorry,

337
00:23:57,910 --> 00:23:59,210
then leave Eun Hwan.

338
00:24:01,280 --> 00:24:03,020
You two can never be together.

339
00:24:05,190 --> 00:24:07,290
I don't think I need to tell you that anymore.

340
00:24:08,620 --> 00:24:10,090
I don't want Eun Hwan...

341
00:24:11,460 --> 00:24:13,630
to be hurt by that accident in any way.

342
00:24:16,760 --> 00:24:18,260
You know what I mean, right?

343
00:24:26,370 --> 00:24:28,040
Hey, hey. Did you see the news?

344
00:24:28,340 --> 00:24:29,780
Did Yu Ji An really disappear?

345
00:24:29,980 --> 00:24:32,579
Hey, disappearing would be better. What if it's...

346
00:24:32,580 --> 00:24:35,579
Hey, watch what you say. It can't be that, right?

347
00:24:35,580 --> 00:24:37,250
Anyway, the two of them fought a lot.

348
00:24:37,480 --> 00:24:38,950
That's right. I heard that too.

349
00:24:39,690 --> 00:24:41,790
Didn't she say she wished she would just disappear?

350
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:43,790
I wish you would just...

351
00:24:44,390 --> 00:24:46,630
disappear from my life.

352
00:24:47,130 --> 00:24:48,259
It was really harsh.

353
00:24:48,260 --> 00:24:49,960
Hey, let's not just speculate among ourselves.

354
00:24:50,060 --> 00:24:51,560
Right. It can't be that.

355
00:24:53,100 --> 00:24:54,430
If it is, that would be crazy.

356
00:25:01,640 --> 00:25:03,880
Stop drinking. You're going to ruin your health.

357
00:25:06,880 --> 00:25:08,520
I think I'm being punished.

358
00:25:08,920 --> 00:25:09,920
You idiot.

359
00:25:10,950 --> 00:25:12,250
What do you have to be punished for?

360
00:25:12,820 --> 00:25:14,620
I made her cry too often.

361
00:25:16,290 --> 00:25:17,660
That beautiful woman.

362
00:25:19,560 --> 00:25:20,960
When I think about it,

363
00:25:21,800 --> 00:25:24,530
I never really gave her anything.

364
00:25:28,000 --> 00:25:29,340
I always held back.

365
00:25:31,640 --> 00:25:34,670
I always held back expressing my feelings and smiling.

366
00:25:40,980 --> 00:25:43,080
I was afraid that I might get too greedy.

367
00:25:44,620 --> 00:25:46,450
I was also afraid I wouldn't be able to handle myself.

368
00:25:48,990 --> 00:25:51,560
So I always kept my distance.

369
00:25:55,300 --> 00:25:56,360
And that always...

370
00:26:00,070 --> 00:26:01,230
made her cry.

371
00:26:07,070 --> 00:26:08,840
If I had known I'd regret it this much,

372
00:26:11,510 --> 00:26:13,210
I should have given her everything instead of holding back.

373
00:26:14,250 --> 00:26:15,520
I'm sure she's okay.

374
00:26:17,920 --> 00:26:18,950
Don't worry.

375
00:26:19,820 --> 00:26:21,390
I will find her no matter what.

376
00:26:22,920 --> 00:26:23,920
I'll find her,

377
00:26:26,690 --> 00:26:27,790
and this time,

378
00:26:31,930 --> 00:26:33,200
I'll protect her for sure.

379
00:26:45,910 --> 00:26:47,810
(Let's eat Americano after getting an attendance stamp.)

380
00:27:00,830 --> 00:27:05,970
(1 dollar)

381
00:27:11,840 --> 00:27:14,170
- You're not hurt? - No.

382
00:27:15,180 --> 00:27:16,380
Then I'm glad about that.

383
00:27:39,200 --> 00:27:42,369
Right now, I'm about to do the most selfish thing...

384
00:27:42,370 --> 00:27:43,600
in my life.

385
00:28:05,630 --> 00:28:08,930
(Scene in the Police Station, Day)

386
00:28:20,070 --> 00:28:24,410
(Scene in the House, Night)

387
00:28:28,010 --> 00:28:30,049
I'm afraid.

388
00:28:30,050 --> 00:28:32,490
I'm afraid she'll show up again and ruin my life.

389
00:28:33,020 --> 00:28:34,690
I'm afraid I'll go back as the person I was.

390
00:28:35,490 --> 00:28:36,560
If that happens,

391
00:28:37,990 --> 00:28:39,290
I'll protect you.

392
00:28:40,890 --> 00:28:42,060
I was wrong.

393
00:28:45,000 --> 00:28:46,100
So please...

394
00:28:49,170 --> 00:28:51,340
Please stop torturing me and just show up.

395
00:28:55,070 --> 00:28:56,510
If you just show up,

396
00:29:00,150 --> 00:29:01,920
I'll keep my promise this time.

397
00:29:06,450 --> 00:29:07,450
Please.

398
00:29:16,900 --> 00:29:18,200
(Woo Dong Gyeong)

399
00:29:26,070 --> 00:29:27,470
(Woo Dong Gyeong)

400
00:29:28,880 --> 00:29:30,680
- Hello. - Hey, I remember now.

401
00:29:31,280 --> 00:29:32,310
It's the fishing spot.

402
00:29:36,850 --> 00:29:40,190
Dong Gyeong, do you know where that is?

403
00:29:40,590 --> 00:29:41,590
Where?

404
00:29:42,490 --> 00:29:44,160
The place where Eun Hwan ran off to.

405
00:29:45,120 --> 00:29:46,530
I was the one who told her about it.

406
00:29:49,100 --> 00:29:50,330
Why are you just telling me this now?

407
00:30:30,870 --> 00:30:31,870
Eun Hwan?

408
00:30:38,210 --> 00:30:40,110
How did you know I was here?

409
00:30:41,350 --> 00:30:43,050
This is the best place you could run away to?

410
00:30:43,850 --> 00:30:45,120
How anticlimactic.

411
00:30:46,750 --> 00:30:49,390
I was ready to find you at the ends of the earth.

412
00:30:54,360 --> 00:30:55,730
You missed me a lot, didn't you?

413
00:30:59,430 --> 00:31:00,430
You're lying.

414
00:31:04,170 --> 00:31:06,270
I really missed you.

415
00:31:19,090 --> 00:31:20,220
I'm sorry for leaving you alone.

416
00:31:26,830 --> 00:31:28,030
I'm also sorry for not protecting you.

417
00:31:30,560 --> 00:31:31,560
I'm really...

418
00:31:33,830 --> 00:31:34,970
I'm so sorry.

419
00:32:00,430 --> 00:32:02,559
(Receipt)

420
00:32:02,560 --> 00:32:04,000
This is for one week's stay?

421
00:32:04,860 --> 00:32:07,429
No way. It's not like this is a hotel suite.

422
00:32:07,430 --> 00:32:08,530
Tell me about it.

423
00:32:09,170 --> 00:32:13,069
She comes to a guesthouse in the countryside and what? What?

424
00:32:13,070 --> 00:32:14,639
- What? - How many times...

425
00:32:14,640 --> 00:32:15,640
do I have to say it, ma'am?

426
00:32:16,380 --> 00:32:17,409
Amenities.

427
00:32:17,410 --> 00:32:18,439
Gosh.

428
00:32:18,440 --> 00:32:20,309
Anyway, amenities or whatever.

429
00:32:20,310 --> 00:32:21,950
I've never met anyone looking for things like that.

430
00:32:22,320 --> 00:32:23,379
Not only that,

431
00:32:23,380 --> 00:32:26,489
she showed up without a penny to her name.

432
00:32:26,490 --> 00:32:29,090
Including food and clothes, she owes me over 1,000 dollars.

433
00:32:33,290 --> 00:32:36,700
Don't you know it costs a lot to maintain a star's image?

434
00:32:43,240 --> 00:32:46,710
- What was that? - What? What did I do?

435
00:32:47,010 --> 00:32:49,439
I think you just thought, "Did I make a mistake coming here?"

436
00:32:49,440 --> 00:32:52,449
- I felt it. - No, that's ridiculous...

437
00:32:52,450 --> 00:32:53,749
You said you were sorry,

438
00:32:53,750 --> 00:32:55,550
but now you're being so petty about money.

439
00:32:56,380 --> 00:32:57,480
I'm telling you, that's not it.

440
00:32:57,620 --> 00:32:59,249
You just thought that a second ago.

441
00:32:59,250 --> 00:33:00,820
That's absolutely not true. This is so unfair.

442
00:33:00,920 --> 00:33:02,159
That's not it. Why would I think like that?

443
00:33:02,160 --> 00:33:03,559
If you think it's a waste, then just leave.

444
00:33:03,560 --> 00:33:05,629
Why would I leave? I came here for you, Ji An.

445
00:33:05,630 --> 00:33:06,960
Then pay for it.

446
00:33:10,900 --> 00:33:12,329
Why did you run away to a fishing spot...

447
00:33:12,330 --> 00:33:13,630
despite you can't even fish?

448
00:33:14,330 --> 00:33:17,840
I just wanted to run away,

449
00:33:19,040 --> 00:33:20,340
but I didn't know where to go.

450
00:33:22,580 --> 00:33:25,240
And I was also curious about a place you had memories of.

451
00:33:27,280 --> 00:33:28,410
Have things been hard for you?

452
00:33:30,250 --> 00:33:31,280
It was my mom.

453
00:33:32,890 --> 00:33:35,320
She's the one who put CEO Kim up to the abuse of power controversy.

454
00:33:40,030 --> 00:33:42,560
I know, right? Shocking, isn't it?

455
00:33:45,230 --> 00:33:47,100
I couldn't believe it when I heard it.

456
00:33:52,310 --> 00:33:53,310
Are you okay?

457
00:34:01,350 --> 00:34:02,780
She must have thought I'd come running back to her...

458
00:34:06,590 --> 00:34:09,360
if I was struggling.

459
00:34:11,060 --> 00:34:12,190
But too bad for her.

460
00:34:13,489 --> 00:34:14,960
Because now,

461
00:34:16,800 --> 00:34:19,070
I don't think I can put up with her anymore.

462
00:34:25,810 --> 00:34:26,840
This time...

463
00:34:29,679 --> 00:34:31,210
I'll be right by your side.

464
00:34:45,590 --> 00:34:46,589
(Contract Termination Notice)

465
00:34:46,590 --> 00:34:47,590
(Reason: Breach of Trust)

466
00:34:47,730 --> 00:34:48,730
What is this?

467
00:34:49,130 --> 00:34:50,130
It's exactly what it looks like.

468
00:34:50,830 --> 00:34:53,130
I'm terminating all contracts between you and me.

469
00:34:54,469 --> 00:34:58,040
From now on, you have no rights over me.

470
00:34:59,140 --> 00:35:00,470
You're still acting like a child.

471
00:35:01,670 --> 00:35:04,480
If you're having such a hard time, take a few more days off.

472
00:35:05,610 --> 00:35:07,110
I'll take care of your schedule...

473
00:35:07,210 --> 00:35:10,620
Soon, I'll be filing a lawsuit to nullify the contracts...

474
00:35:10,980 --> 00:35:13,350
- you signed without my consent. - You little...

475
00:35:15,790 --> 00:35:19,360
Are you saying you're fine with Cha Eun Hwan finding out the truth?

476
00:35:22,030 --> 00:35:23,730
Is it okay if he knows about why his father died...

477
00:35:24,000 --> 00:35:27,230
and who was responsible for his death?

478
00:35:28,130 --> 00:35:31,800
Do you really think I wouldn't remember anything?

479
00:35:34,640 --> 00:35:36,110
What's there to be scared of?

480
00:35:36,810 --> 00:35:40,410
Just go inside the storage room for a little while.

481
00:35:41,210 --> 00:35:43,680
They said you can be the protagonist.

482
00:35:44,150 --> 00:35:46,390
But I'm still scared.

483
00:35:49,820 --> 00:35:52,630
You don't want to live with me?

484
00:35:56,000 --> 00:36:00,800
Ji An, if we want to live together, we need a house.

485
00:36:04,470 --> 00:36:05,470
You can do it, right?

486
00:36:18,880 --> 00:36:19,890
Let's go.

487
00:36:20,390 --> 00:36:22,119
A while ago, CEO Kim sent me something...

488
00:36:22,120 --> 00:36:24,020
as an apology gift.

489
00:36:26,230 --> 00:36:27,230
Do you want to hear it?

490
00:36:29,200 --> 00:36:30,399
(Call Recording)

491
00:36:30,400 --> 00:36:32,470
To give you what you want,

492
00:36:33,300 --> 00:36:35,770
I have to get what I want first.

493
00:36:36,370 --> 00:36:38,539
- How... - She has to learn...

494
00:36:38,540 --> 00:36:40,070
how tough it is,

495
00:36:40,610 --> 00:36:42,170
so she'll miss my embrace, don't you think?

496
00:36:42,610 --> 00:36:45,680
Push Ji An to rock bottom.

497
00:36:46,510 --> 00:36:48,150
As far as you possibly can.

498
00:36:52,750 --> 00:36:57,290
Ji An, this is all fabricated.

499
00:36:57,420 --> 00:37:00,990
- Like you did to me? - Me? It was for your own good.

500
00:37:02,400 --> 00:37:04,800
In order to protect you, I had to...

501
00:37:06,600 --> 00:37:07,800
keep you by my side.

502
00:37:08,230 --> 00:37:10,400
No parent would destroy their own child...

503
00:37:11,140 --> 00:37:12,440
in order to protect them.

504
00:37:15,370 --> 00:37:16,480
Ji An.

505
00:37:18,010 --> 00:37:19,010
I...

506
00:37:20,650 --> 00:37:22,580
- I did it for... - I will no longer...

507
00:37:23,980 --> 00:37:25,520
destroy myself...

508
00:37:28,050 --> 00:37:29,620
just to be loved by you.

509
00:37:49,940 --> 00:37:50,940
Are you okay?

510
00:39:09,590 --> 00:39:10,720
She probably left him...

511
00:39:11,890 --> 00:39:13,130
because she loved him.

512
00:39:26,770 --> 00:39:27,840
You're awake?

513
00:39:29,780 --> 00:39:31,640
How are you feeling?

514
00:39:35,180 --> 00:39:37,880
Will you go somewhere with me?

515
00:39:39,950 --> 00:39:47,730
(The Late Cha Woo Seok)

516
00:39:54,330 --> 00:39:56,039
If you get scared or feel like you're in danger,

517
00:39:56,040 --> 00:39:57,540
just scream for help.

518
00:39:58,240 --> 00:40:01,870
And I'll come running like Superman to save you.

519
00:40:02,210 --> 00:40:03,210
Got it?

520
00:40:05,880 --> 00:40:07,610
I'm so sorry it took me so long to come.

521
00:40:08,610 --> 00:40:09,620
Sir.

522
00:40:13,050 --> 00:40:14,790
How long have you known?

523
00:40:16,490 --> 00:40:17,760
Not for long.

524
00:40:18,920 --> 00:40:22,800
My memory came back on that last rainy day.

525
00:40:23,560 --> 00:40:25,530
Then why didn't you say anything?

526
00:40:27,870 --> 00:40:30,040
Because I thought if you knew that I knew,

527
00:40:31,100 --> 00:40:33,210
it would be too hard on you, Eun Hwan.

528
00:40:39,080 --> 00:40:40,210
I've grown up a lot, haven't I?

529
00:40:43,880 --> 00:40:44,880
Why...

530
00:40:45,820 --> 00:40:47,420
didn't you hate me?

531
00:40:49,520 --> 00:40:50,990
If it hadn't been for me,

532
00:40:51,760 --> 00:40:53,230
your father...

533
00:40:55,160 --> 00:40:56,160
and sister...

534
00:40:59,500 --> 00:41:01,200
wouldn't have ended up that way.

535
00:41:02,270 --> 00:41:03,740
How could I hate you?

536
00:41:06,640 --> 00:41:08,610
Even when you couldn't remember anything,

537
00:41:10,380 --> 00:41:12,950
you could never let go of the guilt...

538
00:41:14,450 --> 00:41:15,680
and were always in pain.

539
00:41:17,080 --> 00:41:18,550
My heart always went out to you.

540
00:41:20,350 --> 00:41:21,350
So,

541
00:41:22,090 --> 00:41:23,820
you don't have to feel sorry anymore.

542
00:41:24,860 --> 00:41:26,030
That incident was...

543
00:41:27,430 --> 00:41:28,960
no one's...

544
00:41:29,530 --> 00:41:30,700
fault.

545
00:41:31,600 --> 00:41:33,070
It was just an accident.

546
00:41:35,530 --> 00:41:36,670
My father...

547
00:41:37,970 --> 00:41:40,740
wouldn't want you to suffer like this either, Ji An.

548
00:41:44,340 --> 00:41:45,510
You can do that for me, can't you?

549
00:41:51,680 --> 00:41:52,690
We...

550
00:41:54,420 --> 00:41:55,520
can't be together, can we?

551
00:42:07,630 --> 00:42:08,900
Still, I'm glad...

552
00:42:10,870 --> 00:42:13,270
that we can say goodbye in such a beautiful place.

553
00:42:19,480 --> 00:42:20,510
Thank you.

554
00:42:21,980 --> 00:42:23,050
Thanks to you,

555
00:42:24,350 --> 00:42:26,250
I learned how to understand someone...

556
00:42:29,990 --> 00:42:31,620
and how to love someone.

557
00:42:37,130 --> 00:42:38,300
Thank you too...

558
00:42:40,030 --> 00:42:41,500
for coming into my life...

559
00:42:43,440 --> 00:42:46,310
and letting me know how brightly...

560
00:42:48,970 --> 00:42:50,110
I could smile.

561
00:43:20,640 --> 00:43:24,380
(1 Year Later)

562
00:43:27,410 --> 00:43:28,579
(Best Supporting Actress: Yu Ji An)

563
00:43:28,580 --> 00:43:30,019
(March Individual Brand Reputation: Number 1)

564
00:43:30,020 --> 00:43:31,750
("Yu Ji An, Best Supporting Actress at Yeongjong Film Awards")

565
00:43:34,120 --> 00:43:35,349
(Only Yu Ji An could play Jung In.)

566
00:43:35,350 --> 00:43:36,590
(She deserves this.)

567
00:43:38,660 --> 00:43:39,660
Yes.

568
00:43:40,630 --> 00:43:42,559
Mr. Cha, it's almost time for your lecture.

569
00:43:42,560 --> 00:43:44,400
Oh, yes.

570
00:43:50,500 --> 00:43:51,999
(What is "Empathy?")

571
00:43:52,000 --> 00:43:53,540
(About True Empathy in This Era)

572
00:43:54,110 --> 00:43:55,110
Everyone,

573
00:43:55,740 --> 00:43:57,040
what is empathy?

574
00:43:58,480 --> 00:44:02,080
When we say we're empathizing, we often try to explain things...

575
00:44:02,480 --> 00:44:03,680
or solve the problem.

576
00:44:04,520 --> 00:44:05,950
But that's not what empathy is.

577
00:44:07,020 --> 00:44:10,460
It's something you can feel just by being there for someone.

578
00:44:10,920 --> 00:44:14,430
The foundation of my method acting is empathy.

579
00:44:15,060 --> 00:44:16,829
If you don't understand the character's feelings...

580
00:44:16,830 --> 00:44:19,160
and just go through the motions,

581
00:44:20,100 --> 00:44:21,530
that's an insult to the acting.

582
00:44:22,730 --> 00:44:25,170
You saw how my acting improved overnight, didn't you?

583
00:44:25,970 --> 00:44:30,040
What's the secret? Repeat after me. Empathy.

584
00:44:30,610 --> 00:44:31,610
Empathy.

585
00:44:31,940 --> 00:44:34,480
That's right. You have to act with your heart.

586
00:44:34,980 --> 00:44:35,980
Empathy.

587
00:44:41,390 --> 00:44:43,190
Why won't anyone believe me?

588
00:44:44,320 --> 00:44:46,590
I know. I know...

589
00:44:47,190 --> 00:44:48,430
what I did was wrong.

590
00:44:49,360 --> 00:44:51,100
I only did it because I was so scared that day.

591
00:44:51,560 --> 00:44:52,970
Just once,

592
00:44:53,570 --> 00:44:57,000
couldn't you try to understand how I was feeling?

593
00:44:59,400 --> 00:45:00,410
Ha Yul.

594
00:45:02,540 --> 00:45:03,580
Mom.

595
00:45:06,680 --> 00:45:08,979
- Have you been having fun? - Yes.

596
00:45:08,980 --> 00:45:10,880
Did you go on the slide a lot? How many times?

597
00:45:11,550 --> 00:45:13,589
- Hello. Here you are. - Thank you.

598
00:45:13,590 --> 00:45:14,949
You can go up to the second floor now.

599
00:45:14,950 --> 00:45:16,690
(Cha Song Hwan Solo Exhibition: After-image And Reality)

600
00:45:17,390 --> 00:45:18,560
- Thank you. - Welcome.

601
00:45:19,560 --> 00:45:21,689
- Congratulations. - Thanks for coming. You're busy.

602
00:45:21,690 --> 00:45:23,459
- Thank you. - I came with a friend.

603
00:45:23,460 --> 00:45:24,730
These are amazing.

604
00:45:44,380 --> 00:45:45,420
You made it.

605
00:45:47,090 --> 00:45:48,120
What do you think of the exhibition?

606
00:45:50,560 --> 00:45:52,190
It's great. You did a good job.

607
00:45:54,790 --> 00:45:55,990
Do you still contact to Ji An?

608
00:45:58,960 --> 00:45:59,970
No.

609
00:46:01,370 --> 00:46:03,000
You know tomorrow is the anniversary of Dad's death, right?

610
00:46:06,140 --> 00:46:08,440
I guess it'll be hard for you to make it.

611
00:46:09,680 --> 00:46:10,940
So I'll have to go alone, right?

612
00:46:11,980 --> 00:46:13,150
I'm sorry, Eun Hwan.

613
00:46:15,180 --> 00:46:17,620
Even though I knew my unhappiness wasn't your fault,

614
00:46:18,920 --> 00:46:20,720
back then, I needed someone to blame...

615
00:46:21,490 --> 00:46:23,160
just to get through it.

616
00:46:24,660 --> 00:46:27,230
I really wanted to apologise to you.

617
00:46:28,360 --> 00:46:29,360
And...

618
00:46:30,630 --> 00:46:31,730
to Ji An too.

619
00:46:34,670 --> 00:46:35,900
I think...

620
00:46:37,400 --> 00:46:39,040
this answer is enough.

621
00:46:42,010 --> 00:46:43,340
Have a good visit to meet Dad tomorrow.

622
00:47:13,010 --> 00:47:16,170
(The Late Cha Woo Seok)

623
00:47:47,470 --> 00:47:48,470
No way.

624
00:47:50,540 --> 00:47:52,210
There's no way I can feel this.

625
00:47:54,250 --> 00:47:55,650
It's been over for ages.

626
00:47:59,120 --> 00:48:00,120
Yu Ji An.

627
00:48:02,690 --> 00:48:03,790
Where on earth are you?

628
00:48:05,060 --> 00:48:06,060
Please.

629
00:48:07,060 --> 00:48:08,430
Just appear in front of me.
